  "notes": "Recorded as GAAP-style (fund-balance roll-forward; government-wide statements include capital assets and depreciation; the GF departmental schedule says modified cash basis). Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds (p4); beginning fund balance 550,234.80 plus 'RESTATED, See Note 6' 61,583.95 as adjustment. Business-type from proprietary Total column; Bond fees (4,586.63) printed under Other Financing Sources (Uses) recorded as business other_financing; restatement 71,891.84 recorded as business_type.restatement. Proprietary cash flows beginning cash = as restated 1,172,779.75. The only all-funds supplementary schedule is the combined budgetary-basis Budget and Actual - All Funds (p10), not recorded; detail = GF departments combining schedule (p11) plus per-fund columns of the governmental (Street, Sales Tax, Keno) and proprietary (Electric, Water, Sewer, Waste) statements. Ambulance spending counted in General government to tie to the statement (p4). Read pages 1-11 of 11"
